      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEON DRIFT (4) is an honest type who is having her first look at course. Last start winner off the rails draw scoring by one length at Casino over 300m (16.79). Won at her only start from this draw. Well placed and can measure up. DEPUTY (1) was in the minor money with a handy 18.98, finishing third in a Grade 5 at this track last start. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. AFFILIATED (3) has a superb record at this track and trip, unbeaten so far from four starts. In the money last time at Rockhampton (24.25) in a Grade 5, finishing a 5.5 lengths third. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. PIPER BEACH (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
